sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant UI as Streamlit app (app/)
    participant S as core/session.py
    participant E as Engine (src/slotsmith)
    U->>UI: Open landing page, choose "Run the synthetic demo" or upload on Input
    UI->>S: load_synthetic() or load_uploads()
    S->>E: generate()/make_revision() or read_mdb() (via safe_read_mdb)
    E-->>S: MDB rows + column mapping, or a readable error (previous data kept)
    U->>UI: Open Review
    UI->>E: validate() through compute_preflight_audit()
    E-->>UI: cable blocks and TQs (findings)
    U->>UI: Edit rule parameters (optional), press Allocate
    UI->>S: run_allocation()
    S->>E: pipeline.run(paths, rules, out.xlsx)
    E->>E: validate, allocate, build rows, write workbook
    E->>E: load_allocation(out.xlsx), verify(), rewrite workbook with Rule Check
    E-->>S: RunResult (rows, TQs, 11-row check, timings)
    S-->>UI: results page (verifier banner, tiles, TQs, cabinets)
    U->>UI: Inspect Results and Cabinets
    U->>UI: Revise: choose Rev B, press Compare and re-allocate
    UI->>S: run_revision()
    S->>E: revise(Rev A rows, Rev B rows, rules)
    E-->>S: Rev B rows, impact list, solver log
    S->>E: write_workbook(), load_allocation(), verify(), rewrite with Rule Check
    S-->>UI: impact tiles, solver summary, Rev B download
    U->>UI: Deliverables: download workbooks and rule set
    U->>UI: Start over (confirm): clears data and results, keeps rules
